Years of experience: 6
English level: upper

Optimized regression testing and reduce scope of testing in 40%.
Started and organized flow for BDD automation.
I've experience in most various projects: medical, gambling, integration with social, hotels business and betting platforms, mobile video streaming.
I used to perform tests on most popular platforms: WEB, iOS, Android. Leading distributed QA teams (5+ engineers, junior to senior specialists)
- Experience in testing:
web client-server applications,
mobile testing (guidelines for iOS and Android);
- API testing by Postman;
- leading team of 5 QAs;
- experience in mentoring Junior QA;
- automation by writing BDD test scenarios (Cucumber);
- automation by using Katalon tool;
- experience in developing and maintaining Test Plan, Test Summary Reports, test cases, traceability matrices, check lists, bug reports;
- experience in analysis and testing requirements;
- working in Agile team – take part in all activities: planning, grooming, retrospectives;
- knowledge of TCP/IP/ HTTP protocol;
- work with JSON and XML files;
- knowledge of DB and SQL;
- web technologies (HTML, CSS);
- version control systems (Git, SVN);
- CI tools – Jenkins;
- using JIRA, Confluence;
- Test Case Management: Test Rail.
Development as a leader and manager.
It is also desirable to have possibility to growth in test automation

